    {
      "id": "claim_abfd156147ab4d8a9eb77d536074b0cc",
      "statement": "continueTask assembles a last-5-messages textual prefix from taskMessages only when !isResumedSandbox, and passes isResumedSandbox + currentTask.agentSessionId to executeAgentInSandbox so the per-agent wrapper can append its --resume (claude/copilot/cursor), --session / --continue (opencode), codex resume --last (codex), or no resume (gemini) flag. The CLI's --resume carries the full conversation; the textual prefix is the fallback for fresh sandboxes and the only path for Gemini.",
