    {
      "id": "claim_824f83ece66447c9979428fafe3a320f",
      "statement": "The continue handler re-consults task.keepAlive on both the success and the error branches after pushChangesToBranch returns: keepAlive=true logs 'Sandbox kept alive for follow-up messages' and leaves sandboxId/sandboxUrl intact; keepAlive=false runs unregisterSandbox(taskId) + shutdownSandbox(sandbox). pushFailed===true always settles the row to status='error' regardless of keepAlive.",
