    {
      "id": "claim_a3ad2ffc9bb74d5eb776f4176df073c3",
      "statement": "components/task-chat.tsx is the chat panel that drives the follow-up surface. handleSendMessage fires fetch POST /api/tasks/:taskId/continue with { message }, clears the input optimistically, restores it on error, and refreshes the messages list. TaskChat polls GET /api/tasks/:taskId/messages every 3 seconds (faster than the 5-second useTask poll) so the just-inserted user bubble appears within a tick of the click. The stop button (handleStopTask) hits PATCH /api/tasks/:taskId with { action: 'stop' } and uses an isStopping flag to prevent double-clicks. PR review comments can be sent as follow-ups via handleSendCommentAsFollowUp, which formats the comment into the chat input rather than submitting directly.",
